NeuroMap 3D Brain — licence notice
==================================

This repository is multi-licensed. The components do NOT all share one
licence, and the Apache 2.0 code licence does not relicense the 3D assets.

CODE
----
Viewer source code (src/*.js, src/*.css, index.html), build and validation
scripts (scripts/*.mjs), configuration (package.json, vite.config.*) and
CI/deploy workflows (.github/workflows/*):

